" — fill #FFF3E0, border #E76F51, 1.5pt\nBox 5 (output): \"EN / ZH Parallel\\nConflict Data\" — fill #E8F5E9 (light green), border #2D6A4F (forest green), 2pt, slightly larger\n\nArrows: thin (#8B8B8B, 1pt), small arrowheads, elegant not bulky.\nSection reference below: \"§3.2 Data\" in 8pt italic gray.\n\n=== PANEL (b): \"Probing Framework\" (center, ~38% width) ===\nTop section: two stacked boxes:\n- \"Residual Stream Extraction\\n(last-token, all L layers)\" — fill #EDF2FB, border #4361EE\n- \"Linear Probe Training\\n(per-layer logistic regression)\" — fill #EDF2FB, border #4361EE\n\nMiddle section: \"4-Direction Transfer Protocol\" label in bold 10pt.\nBelow it: a 2×2 grid/matrix:\n- Column headers: \"Train EN\" and \"Train ZH\"\n- Row headers: \"Test EN\" and \"Test ZH\"\n- Cells: \"EN→EN\" (fill #DBEAFE), \"ZH→EN\" (fill #FEF3C7), \"EN→ZH\" (fill #FEF3C7), \"ZH→ZH\" (fill #DBEAFE)\n- Same-language cells (EN→EN, ZH→ZH) in blue tint; cross-lingual cells (EN→ZH, ZH→EN) in warm tint\n- Each cell has thin border #CBD5E1\n\nBottom: \"Bootstrap CI (n = 2000)\" box — fill #F8F9FA, border #ADB5BD\n\nArrows connecting top boxes to matrix to bottom box.\nSection reference: \"§3.4–3.5 Probing\" in 8pt italic gray.\n\n=== PANEL (c): \"Confound Exclusion\" (right, ~29% width) ===\nThree items in a clean checklist layout, each with a green checkmark (✓) icon:\n1. \"COMET Tercile Ablation\" — with small subtitle \"Translation quality control\"\n2. \"Token Overlap Analysis\" — with small subtitle \"Surface feature exclusion\"\n3. \"XNLI Non-conflict Baseline\" — with small subtitle \"Task specificity verification\"\n\nEach item in a rounded box with fill #F0FFF4 (very light green), border #2D6A4F (forest green), 1pt.\nGreen checkmark (#2D6A4F) to the left of each item, 14pt.\nSection reference: \"§3.6 Controls\" in 8pt italic gray.\n\n=== CONNECTING ARROWS BETWEEN PANELS ===\n- Large horizontal arrow from Panel (a) output box to Panel (b) top box: thicker (2pt), #4361EE, elegant arrowhead\n- Large horizontal arrow from Panel (b) to Panel (c): thicker (2pt), #2D6A4F, elegant arrowhead\n\n=== OVERALL STYLE ===\n- Publication quality for EMNLP 2026 (top venue)\n- Elegant, premium, sophisticated — NOT cheap or homework-like\n- PURE WHITE (#FFFFFF) figure background — NO tinted panel backgrounds, NO gray backgrounds, NO colored section backgrounds. Each panel sits on white.\n- Subtle drop shadows on ALL boxes: 2px offset down-right, 8% opacity, #000000\n- Rounded corners 10px on all rectangles\n- Thin, elegant arrow heads — not bulky matplotlib defaults\n- Font: serif (Times New Roman or DejaVu Serif) for all labels, 10pt body text, 12pt panel titles, 8pt subtitles/references\n- Panel labels \"(a)\", \"(b)\", \"(c)\" in 12pt bold serif at top-left of each panel\n- Panel titles \"Data Construction\", \"Probing Framework\", \"Confound Exclusion\" in 12pt bold, centered above each panel\n- Thin vertical dashed lines (#D0D0D0, 0.5pt) as panel separators between (a)|(b) and (b)|(c)\n- Muted, harmonious academic color palette:\n  - Blue family: #4361EE (royal), #DBEAFE (tint), #EDF2FB (bg)\n  - Warm family: #E76F51 (terracotta), #FEF3C7 (tint), #FFF3E0 (bg)\n  - Green family: #2D6A4F (forest), #E8F5E9 (bg), #F0FFF4 (light)\n  - Neutral: #8B8B8B (arrows), #ADB5BD (borders), #F8F9FA (light bg)\n- NO saturated primary colors, NO tab10 colors, NO default blue/orange\n- Generous white space between panels (wspace=0.08 within subplots, plus visual separation)\n- Consistent visual weight across all three panels\n- All text must be ≥ 7pt when figure is scaled to \\textwidth (~6.5 inches)\n- Inter-panel connecting arrows must be prominent (2.5pt, colored) and clearly visible\n- The entire image is rendered as a vector-like matplotlib figure using FancyBboxPatch and FancyArrowPatch, NOT as a raster/AI-generated image\n","structuredPatch":[{"oldStart":1,"oldLines":5,"newStart":1,"newLines":12,"lines":[" Full-width academic pipeline figure for EMNLP 2026 submi